{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "09548634-0539-8cd0-9e56-6cfdc3a17ac0",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T11:27:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Esteban Valdez",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:24:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:24:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Sorry, I'm going to talk quiet. Somebody is sleeping in the next room."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:24:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no problem at all, take your time. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I found a cat. A lost cat, I think. It has a collar, a blue one. It was by my steps this morning, and it's very thin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:25:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Aw, poor thing. Is it with you now? Is it inside or outside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:25:10-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Outside still. On the porch. I put a bowl of water out. I don't know if I should touch it. Um, there are children who walk by here to the school, every morning and afternoon. I worry they will try to pick it up. If it's scared, it might scratch them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:25:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good thought. Does the collar have a tag on it, a name or a phone number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:25:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I didn't want to get close. I see something small on it, silver, like a tag. I can't read it from the door. My eyes, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. And where are you located, sir?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:25:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "314 Chapel Street. In the Historic Hill, up from the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:25:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 314 Chapel. And can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:25:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Esteban Valdez."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:26:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Valdez. Hang on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:26:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] Excuse me, my phone is buzzing in my pocket. It's my mother. She calls two times a day, every day. I let it ring. I will call her back after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:26:17-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you go right ahead and let it ring, we'll get this sorted first. Okay, I'm back. So animal control handles stray animals, and I'm going to send them your address and the details. Is this a good number, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:26:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0196."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:26:36-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0196. I'll note a thin cat with a blue collar and a tag, on the porch, and that there are kids who pass by. If you can, keep the door closed and don't try to grab it. Cats can bite when they're frightened."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. I will stay inside. Is it okay if I give it some food? A little tuna?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:27:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little food is fine, that might keep it there so the officer can find it. Just from a distance, not hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:27:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And somebody will come today? I don't want it to run to the street. After the storm last weekend, the Saturday into Sunday one, everything was so cold. I think it was out in that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:27:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It could very well have been, poor baby. I can't tell you the exact hour, but I'm sending this over right now and they'll likely call you at that number before they come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:27:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. I will watch from the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:27:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You do that. Thanks for caring about it, Mr. Valdez. Somebody will be in touch. Take care now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:27:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
